9182	Momokuri	After taking one hundred secret photos and observing him from afar for months, second-year high schooler Yuki Kurihara has finally mustered up the courage to ask out her first-year crush Shinya Momo Momotsuki. Although taken by surprise, the bashful Momo accepts; however, he does not know the profoundly abnormal truth. As her strait-laced friend, Norika Mizuyama, has observed, Yuki has developed some unnerving—but nonetheless sincere—habits: taking pictures of Momo in secret, doing extensive research into his personal life, collecting his used straws, and even going Momo watching.  Though Momo remains blissfully unaware of his new girlfriends peculiar habits, he does notice some oddities in their daily conversations. Still unsure and nervous about his first relationship, Momo finds himself regularly getting into awkward interactions due to his inexperience, but nevertheless resolves to make his new girlfriend happy.  Momokuri follows Yuki and Momo as they shyly explore their newfound love, and also deal with the problems that arise from it.	86	73.900000000000000000000000000000	\N	t	\N	\N	ONA	\N	2015	26	\N	62	2024-11-09 09:04:14.487	2024-11-09 09:04:14.487	\N	1
