16839	100-man no Inochi no Ue ni Ore wa Tatteiru 2nd Season	Once again, the Game Masters world of quests unexpectedly pulls in Yuusuke Yotsuya and the rest of this old team. Accompanied by the newest addition, Keita Torii, the team reunites with Kahabell, still unaware of their actions impact on this world.   After bidding Kahabell farewell, the team sets out on their newly appointed quest—an offering of a Jiffon Buffalo at Vaikdamnia on Jiffon Island. However, as their journey to the island commences, the team shortly finds that the quest is not as simple as it initially seemed.  In fact, the island is terrorized by orcs that have made a deal with its inhabitants: instead of devouring the islanders, the orcs will be granted buffalo. With the growing shortage of buffalo, the annual Vaikdamnia festival cannot proceed. But, given the importance of the teams quest, they are left with the obvious choice—rid the island of the orcs and save the islanders.	103	85.800000000000000000000000000000	\N	t	\N	\N	TV	\N	2021	12	\N	39	2024-11-09 09:04:14.487	2024-11-09 09:04:14.487	\N	1
